          "body": "@ismaelrti look good\n\ncan you fix/look (on an another commit) this warning\n\n\n```\npacket-rtps.c:6416:19: warning: binary integer literals are a GNU extension [-Wgnu-binary-literal]\npacket-rtps.c:6417:9: warning: binary integer literals are a GNU extension [-Wgnu-binary-literal]\npacket-rtps.c:6418:50: warning: binary integer literals are a GNU extension [-Wgnu-binary-literal]\npacket-rtps.c:6434:49: warning: binary integer literals are a GNU extension [-Wgnu-binary-literal]\npacket-rtps.c:9438:46: warning: binary integer literals are a GNU extension [-Wgnu-binary-literal]\npacket-rtps.c:9450:37: warning: binary integer literals are a GNU extension [-Wgnu-binary-literal]\npacket-rtps.c:9129:3: warning: code will never be executed [-Wunreachable-code]\n\npacket-rtps.c:2978:34: warning: Access to field 'bound' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'info') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-rtps.c:3055:63: warning: Access to field 'base_type_id' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'info') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-rtps.c:3128:26: warning: Access to field 'base_type_id' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'info') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-rtps.c:3180:17: warning: Access to field 'extensibility' results in a dereference of a null pointer (loaded from variable 'info') [core.NullDereference]\npacket-rtps.c:3564:85: warning: The right operand of '==' is a garbage value [core.UndefinedBinaryOperatorResult]\n```",
